{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/命运•转动","pageid":6569,"revid":16607,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E5%8A%A8&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E5%8A%A8&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E5%8A%A8&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>命运•转动</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.91.BD.E8.BF.90.E2.80.A2.E8.BD.AC.E5.8A.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"命运•转动\"><b>命运•转动</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 命运•转动.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1b/d0qwfaf43h1ych5wv64itqeob456wov.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E5%8A%A8.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/1b/d0qwfaf43h1ych5wv64itqeob456wov.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E2%80%A2%E8%BD%AC%E5%8A%A8.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/d0qwfaf43h1ych5wv64itqeob456wov.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />命运•转动\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（抉择）选择使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"宿命指定\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">宿命指定</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"因果牵引\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">因果牵引</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"悖律拒斥\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">悖律拒斥</font></span></span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"故事反转\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">故事反转</font></span></span>]。<br />✦抉择技能释放后，对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"命运•注视\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">命运•注视</font></span></span>]的目标触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">晶能星爆</font></span>]，造成一半伤害。<br />✦处于[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"原初之力\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">原初之力</font></span></span>]期间，每回合首次释放抉择技能后获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"再攻击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">再攻击</font></span></span>]，继承剩余移动力。<br />✦每个抉择技能每回合最多释放<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/lekhjouylcdedt30jvnh0upev2fjg1n.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td st